# The Qwen3-32B staircase: tensor parallelism 2, 2 prefill and 2 decode pods, buckets A (1000 tokens in,
# 1000 out, Poisson), B (8000 in, 200 out, Poisson) and C (8000 in, 200 out, Ca^2 4), flow control off and on.
# The model is the planner at this commit on the run's warm-up, frozen as the run froze it; the client is what
# the run measured. Error is the model over the client, less 1: + reads slow (a TTFT, a TPOT) or promises
# more than was held (a rate, a knee). go test ./cmd/capacity-planner -run TestStaircaseQ32 -update rewrites it.
